{"1897060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VELASTER", "steam_appid": 1897060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Built Around Parries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parrying is not optional — it is the core of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master precise timing to counter relentless enemies, chain consecutive parries, and dismantle aggressive bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/aa113c987e3ac9a411473235abaff863.poster.avif?t=1768378234\" width=1000 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/aa113c987e3ac9a411473235abaff863.webm?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/aa113c987e3ac9a411473235abaff863.mp4?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/af0e9d8df63b7743b6f46fd96cbfdc13.poster.avif?t=1768378234\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/af0e9d8df63b7743b6f46fd96cbfdc13.webm?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/af0e9d8df63b7743b6f46fd96cbfdc13.mp4?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Middle-earth space - Malum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the past, demons and angels followed a rule that could not invade the realm of human habitation. However, the need between angels and demons required a space where they could coexist. Since they are not gods, they cannot create from nothing. They dragged some of these inhabited areas from humans and created a place called Middle-earth. Middle-earth became the coexistence of angels, demons, and humans, some of whom were drawn from the Middle-earth birth. It was called Malum. However, the peace they have built up is overthrown too easily through minor disputes, turning into a terrible war of blood and flesh and maggots. Twisted, corrupted, and rotting under countless piles of corpses, Malum begins to contaminate all living things within...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/6163cd5391cd7997159a3415240a2a12.poster.avif?t=1768378234\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/6163cd5391cd7997159a3415240a2a12.webm?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/6163cd5391cd7997159a3415240a2a12.mp4?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For revenge...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive in a dark, hazy and misty Mallum in a bloody battle against grotesque and horrific monsters.<br>You don't know who you are, where you are, or why you have to fight the monsters before your eyes. But somewhere inside the castle that rises in the distance. put a knife in your heart <br>All I know is that a target of revenge awaits. But you are too weak to seek revenge. Smell of sulfur and rotting flesh <br>Survive the terrifying space and become strong enough to quench your wrath. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/a61e32244e66765c773f3e11d2300ab4.poster.avif?t=1768378234\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/a61e32244e66765c773f3e11d2300ab4.webm?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/a61e32244e66765c773f3e11d2300ab4.mp4?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experience beyond a simple side-scrolling game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless battles against countless bosses !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of a dark fantasy world and taste true victory as you overcome its overwhelming foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/44768808f02eaf3b741937f86a8f93f2.avif?t=1768378234\" width=588 height=101 /></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Built Around Parries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parrying is not optional — it is the core of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master precise timing to counter relentless enemies, chain consecutive parries, and dismantle aggressive bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/aa113c987e3ac9a411473235abaff863.poster.avif?t=1768378234\" width=1000 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897060/extras/aa113c987e3ac9a411473235abaff863.webm?t=1768378234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared